{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_08DAB0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"她当初安插的那名潜伏特工，后来成了双重间谍。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"他倒向苏联，开始向美国发送假情报……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"而当The Boss知道原因后，更是大吃一惊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"原来CIA的当地联络员一直在克扣潜伏特工的报酬。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"潜伏特工觉得得到的报酬根本配不上所冒的风险，于是在苏联开出的价码面前轻易倒戈了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"从某个时候起，美国的情报行动对东方阵营来说已经毫无秘密可言。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"而且与潜伏特工的报告相反，苏联的载人航天技术其实已经有了巨大进展。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"The Boss亲自潜入<R=第一设计局,OKB-1>，在那里得知了斯普特尼克5号的真相。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=第一设计局,OKB-1>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"航天器重返大气层后，会在7000米高空把飞行员连同座椅一起弹射出去……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"这就是苏联为陆地着陆想出的答案。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"斯普特尼克5号上的弹射装置，就是为此而装的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"穿着沉重的宇航服，从高空用降落伞下降……这是极其危险的办法。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"实际上，苏联自己也清楚这一点。首次成功飞行的加加林，甚至在重返大气层前就被破格晋升了两级。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"这是只有苏联才会采用的办法。在那个国家的情报管制下，失败的实验可以轻易被当作“从未发生”……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"NASA收到The Boss带来的情报后，脸色都变了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"再这样下去，“首次载人航天飞行”的伟业就会被苏联抢走。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"那意味着“斯普特尼克冲击”将再次上演……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"CIA同样慌了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"毕竟是他们自己的失误，才让美国一直被假情报牵着鼻子走。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不得不承认，苏联的假情报做得非常高明。他们巧妙地混合真相与谎言，让美国误以为情报活动一直进展顺利。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"那是只有The Boss才能看穿的骗局……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"毫无疑问，苏联一方有相当厉害的高手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"但即便如此，也不能抵消CIA的失败。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"于是CIA想出了一个妙计，来逃避自己的责任。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"对他们来说正巧，前一年的选举中，John F. Kennedy刚刚当选新总统。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"权力交接时，CIA便对不了解来龙去脉的新总统编造了一套谎言。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"他们掩盖自己的失败，一口咬定全部责任都在The Boss——因为是她选中了后来背叛的潜伏特工。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":125,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"他们还说，The Boss没有使用控制潜伏特工最有效、也是最应该使用的一种手段。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"那就是拿潜伏特工的家人做人质……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"The Boss曾说：“确实，那种方法极其有效。可我做不到。无论如何都做不到……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"我想，对曾经被“贤者们”夺走亲生孩子的她来说，唯独这种事是做不出来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"CIA正是利用了这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"Kennedy曾承诺要填平美苏之间的“导弹差距”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"如果输掉太空竞赛，这项承诺就会化为泡影……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"Kennedy又不是与“贤者们”有关系的人，这让事情更加恶化。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"在不知道“贤者们”网络的他眼里，利用这个网络的The Boss看起来简直和内通者没两样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"而等待她的，是残酷的命运……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""}]}